Package: drivesync-iqbal
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pyqt5, libqt5svg5, python3-googleapi, python3-google-auth-oauthlib
Maintainer: Iqbal <iqbal@example.com>
Description: DriveSync by Iqbal - Google Drive sync client
 Selective two-way sync between Google Drive and your computer.
 Choose the folders to sync, sign in with one click, browse and export
 the list of synced files as a tree, and switch between light and dark themes.
